      "candidate_id": "morgan",
      "verdict": "SUPPORT",
      "reason": "明确命名组织者及发送者 Morgan；两处姓名支持同一人物。",
      "sources": [
        {"quote":"本任务由 Morgan 负责组织","clause_id":"c1","occurrence":0,"context_anchor":null},
        {"quote":"Morgan 必须将该报告send给 Rowan","clause_id":"c1","occurrence":0,"context_anchor":null}
      ]
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "organize",
      "verdict": "SUPPORT",
      "reason": "“负责组织”支持任务组织责任及 REQUIRED；不意味着 Morgan 亲自执行所有子操作。",
      "sources": [
        {"quote":"本任务由 Morgan 负责组织","clause_id":"c1","occurrence":0,"context_anchor":null}
      ]
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "verify",
      "verdict": "SUPPORT",
      "reason": "组织任务后的直接操作描述支持核验义务；未明确核验执行者。",
      "sources": [
        {"quote":"本任务由 Morgan 负责组织：verify 隔离环境 中的 permission-6686.csv。","clause_id":"c1","occurrence":0,"context_anchor":null}
      ]
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "environment",
      "verdict": "CONTRADICT",
      "reason": "环境实体本身有依据，但“隔离环境 中的”修饰文件。MAIN 层及 owner=verify 将文件的位置属性绑定成核验事件的位置。",
      "sources": [
        {"quote":"verify 隔离环境 中的 permission-6686.csv","clause_id":"c1","occurrence":0,"context_anchor":null}
      ]
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "permission_file",
      "verdict": "SUPPORT",
      "reason": "该 CSV 是明确的核验对象，作为既有输入有依据；数字属于文件标识。",
      "sources": [
        {"quote":"verify 隔离环境 中的 permission-6686.csv","clause_id":"c1","occurrence":0,"context_anchor":null}
      ]
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "generate",
      "verdict": "SUPPORT",
      "reason": "任务中的“形成”支持独立的报告产出义务。",
      "sources": [
        {"quote":"形成 audit-756841.md","clause_id":"c1","occurrence":0,"context_anchor":null}
      ]
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "report",
      "verdict": "SUPPORT",
      "reason": "明确要求形成该文件，支持 GENERATED_OUTPUT；文件名数字不是产出数量。",
      "sources": [
        {"quote":"形成 audit-756841.md","clause_id":"c1","occurrence":0,"context_anchor":null}
      ]
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "avery",
      "verdict": "SUPPORT",
      "reason": "Avery 是明确命名的审阅执行者。",
      "sources": [
        {"quote":"Avery 必须review该报告","clause_id":"c1","occurrence":0,"context_anchor":null}
      ]
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "review",
      "verdict": "SUPPORT",
      "reason": "“必须review”明确支持 REQUIRED 的审阅事件。",
      "sources": [
        {"quote":"Avery 必须review该报告","clause_id":"c1","occurrence":0,"context_anchor":null}
      ]
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "review_report_ref",
      "verdict": "CONTRADICT",
      "reason": "报告指代及审阅对象有依据，但 EXISTING_INPUT 与其指向本任务 GENERATED_OUTPUT 的身份冲突；被后续事件使用不能抹去其生成来源。",
      "sources": [
        {"quote":"形成 audit-756841.md。Avery 必须review该报告","clause_id":"c1","occurrence":0,"context_anchor":null}
      ]
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "send",
      "verdict": "SUPPORT",
      "reason": "“必须将该报告send给”明确要求发送。",
      "sources": [
        {"quote":"Morgan 必须将该报告send给 Rowan","clause_id":"c1","occurrence":0,"context_anchor":null}
      ]
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "send_report_ref",
      "verdict": "CONTRADICT",
      "reason": "报告指代及发送主题有依据，但 EXISTING_INPUT 与同一报告的任务生成来源冲突。",
      "sources": [
        {"quote":"形成 audit-756841.md。Avery 必须review该报告；Morgan 必须将该报告send给 Rowan","clause_id":"c1","occurrence":0,"context_anchor":null}
      ]
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "rowan",
      "verdict": "SUPPORT",
      "reason": "Rowan 被明确命名为收件人及不承担审批责任的人。",
      "sources": [
        {"quote":"send给 Rowan","clause_id":"c1","occurrence":0,"context_anchor":null},
        {"quote":"Rowan 不负责审批","clause_id":"c1","occurrence":0,"context_anchor":null}
      ]
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "approval_responsibility",
      "verdict": "SUPPORT",
      "reason": "支持否定的审批责任状态；NOT_REQUIRED 仅可解释为 Rowan 无该责任，不能解释为禁止审批、审批已经发生或任务无需任何人审批。",
      "sources": [
        {"quote":"Rowan 不负责审批","clause_id":"c1","occurrence":0,"context_anchor":null}
      ]
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "complete",
      "verdict": "SUPPORT",
      "reason": "“整个任务须…完成”明确要求任务整体完成，并非条件前件。",
      "sources": [
        {"quote":"整个任务须在 30 分钟内完成","clause_id":"c1","occurrence":0,"context_anchor":null}
      ]
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "duration",
      "verdict": "SUPPORT",
      "reason": "明确给出整个任务的 30 分钟时限。",
      "sources": [
        {"quote":"整个任务须在 30 分钟内完成","clause_id":"c1","occurrence":0,"context_anchor":null}
      ]
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "r1",
      "verdict": "SUPPORT",
      "reason": "Morgan 明确承担组织行为，支持真实组织参与。",
      "sources": [
        {"quote":"本任务由 Morgan 负责组织","clause_id":"c1","occurrence":0,"context_anchor":null}
      ]
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "r2",
